{% comment %}
@description: Danh sach bai viet, co phan trang.
@required_substrings: {% layout "layout" %}, {% block content %}, {% endblock %}, posts, post.slug, post.title, hasNext, hasPrev
@required_ids: 
@notes: posts[] tung phan tu co slug/title/excerpt/coverImage/publishedAt/categories[]. hasPrev/hasNext/prevPage/nextPage cho phan trang. NÊN CÓ thêm: Ô tìm kiếm bài viết và Danh sách các chuyên mục/tag phổ biến (Category pills).
{% endcomment %}
{% layout "layout" %}
{% block content %}
<section>
    <h1>...</h1>
    <div>
        {% if posts and posts.size > 0 %}
            {% for post in posts %}
                <article>
                    <h2><a href="/blog/{{ post.slug }}">{{ post.title }}</a></h2>
                    ...
                </article>
            {% endfor %}
        {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% if hasPrev or hasNext %}
        {% render "components/common/pagination", basePath: "/blog", hasPrev: hasPrev, hasNext: hasNext, prevPage: prevPage, nextPage: nextPage %}
    {% endif %}
</section>
{% endblock %}